{
  "description": "Site blocks I (#488, docs/design/theme-builder.md 4.1-4.2). Read by blocks-spec/siteBlocks.test.ts (normalizeSiteBlockAttrs, validateBlockDoc with a kind) and api/post_blocks_site_test.go (the sanitizer, prepareForStoreAs). `attrs`: what a block of `type` with `input` keeps, defaults left out. `kinds`: whether a doc of `kind` stores.",
